	"data": "Concept: Designing Reality — Philosophy & Worldview\n\nWhat It Is\nA deep philosophical framework about consciousness, technology, and identity. VR/XR isn't fake — it's an extension of perceived reality. Technology is a spiritual catalyst for humanity's evolution from ego-bound (3D) to presence-based (5D) consciousness. Mirror worlds as tools for state-dependent identity.\n\nKey Themes\nReality is constructed/interpreted through the body — augmentation reveals what was always there\nMultiple selves,…",
